{"2363200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fae & Fauna", "steam_appid": 2363200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Fae &amp; Fauna</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fae &amp; Fauna is an open world creature collecting role-playing game combining the very best elements of the genre! Decorate and expand your home, complete quests, craft new gear and head out on exciting adventures with your pet companions, called Faeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take on the role as a research assistant at the Saltwick Academy, where not all is what it seems...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/ad1b2242f9759a5ae80f6438e4dd360e.avif?t=1787741444\" width=1555 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/148457503638bc3854d9985288981461.avif?t=1787741444\" width=1555 height=155 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/4e1b15c381e545b224d18743399ee696.avif?t=1787741444\" width=1555 height=180 /></span><strong>Create Your Character</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set out on your adventure in Saltwick as your own unique character. Customize your appearance with a variety of hairstyles, colours, and clothing before choosing character background and personality quirks which will affect the challenges and opportunities you encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/4ca24a96da6b969f8a819f23ad023e6e.poster.avif?t=1787741444\" width=1170 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/4ca24a96da6b969f8a819f23ad023e6e.webm?t=1787741444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/4ca24a96da6b969f8a819f23ad023e6e.mp4?t=1787741444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/afc5d341de9ffabed6b9e124eecf4e9b.avif?t=1787741444\" width=1555 height=180 /></span><strong>Discover &amp; Befriend Faeons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your adventures, you will befriend, collect and fight alongside the still mysterious creatures known as Faeons. Part of your mission is to learn the unknowns about your companions, and even create new ones using the power of alchemy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/cbc19865b6193eaf5470e7851b53e4dc.poster.avif?t=1787741444\" width=1170 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/cbc19865b6193eaf5470e7851b53e4dc.webm?t=1787741444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/cbc19865b6193eaf5470e7851b53e4dc.mp4?t=1787741444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/6efb412be7d8c40d0c26efc5f1133fcf.avif?t=1787741444\" width=1555 height=180 /></span><strong> Collect Resources &amp; Craft Your Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world around you is filled with trinkets and wonders in physical form. While on your journey, you’ll be able to gather forageables, loot materials for your equipment and pick up magical components for your alchemical concoctions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/efb6a5b11f4eca607c5fdaf5131fe8a2.poster.avif?t=1787741444\" width=1170 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/efb6a5b11f4eca607c5fdaf5131fe8a2.webm?t=1787741444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/efb6a5b11f4eca607c5fdaf5131fe8a2.mp4?t=1787741444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/0d10b1640169d972fdb75170a0dff5d2.avif?t=1787741444\" width=1555 height=180 /></span><strong>Make Your House A Home</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you begin your journey, you’ll be granted a home to call your own. Here you can build and decorate your haven to be a place of comfort in Saltwick. Choose from a variety of decor styles with matching sets to suit your preferred home aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/a973e5687195d62f24868995352312fb.poster.avif?t=1787741444\" width=1170 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/a973e5687195d62f24868995352312fb.webm?t=1787741444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/a973e5687195d62f24868995352312fb.mp4?t=1787741444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/f35933be84565715c1948623da66f2eb.avif?t=1787741444\" width=1555 height=180 /></span><strong>Discover the World and Test Your Combat Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you take on the world of Fae &amp; Fauna, you’ll be able to explore high mountains, deep caves and all magical landscapes in between. Fight the mischievous creatures known as Knytt, find treasures and put your team dynamic to the test against the foes lurking in the forests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/82cc9313ce29309c7a030b9e1a2962cf.poster.avif?t=1787741444\" width=1170 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/82cc9313ce29309c7a030b9e1a2962cf.webm?t=1787741444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/82cc9313ce29309c7a030b9e1a2962cf.mp4?t=1787741444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/bf2504ec9b7bbf4ca9136b5af815bce8.avif?t=1787741444\" width=1555 height=180 /></span><strong>Build Meaningful Relationships &amp; Find Love</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your Fae &amp; Fauna journey you will run into an assortment of characters. Some will sell you delights and necessities for your travels, while others might ask for your aid in quests. Hear their stories, build up your relationships and maybe you’ll even find love amongst your peers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/0b5dcbd331dead6a032578088822cc4b.poster.avif?t=1787741444\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/0b5dcbd331dead6a032578088822cc4b.webm?t=1787741444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/148457503638bc3854d9985288981461.avif?t=1787741444\" width=1555 height=155 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/b1cf05a2e5e44dea191f3a5c512544f2.poster.avif?t=1787741444\" width=600 height=54 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/b1cf05a2e5e44dea191f3a5c512544f2.webm?t=1787741444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Fae &amp; Fauna</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fae &amp; Fauna is an open world creature collecting role-playing game combining the very best elements of the genre! Decorate and expand your home, complete quests, craft new gear and head out on exciting adventures with your pet companions, called Faeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take on the role as a research assistant at the Saltwick Academy, where not all is what it seems...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_par