sts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/82cc9313ce29309c7a030b9e1a2962cf.poster.avif?t=1787741444\" width=1170 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/82cc9313ce29309c7a030b9e1a2962cf.webm?t=1787741444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/82cc9313ce29309c7a030b9e1a2962cf.mp4?t=1787741444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/bf2504ec9b7bbf4ca9136b5af815bce8.avif?t=1787741444\" width=1555 height=180 /></span><strong>Build Meaningful Relationships &amp; Find Love</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your Fae &amp; Fauna journey you will run into an assortment of characters. Some will sell you delights and necessities for your travels, while others might ask for your aid in quests. Hear their stories, build up your relationships and maybe you’ll even find love amongst your peers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/0b5dcbd331dead6a032578088822cc4b.poster.avif?t=1787741444\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/0b5dcbd331dead6a032578088822cc4b.webm?t=1787741444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363200/extras/148457503638bc3854d9985288981461.a